    "body": "There was some discussion around deprecating `dialog.show()` in favor of `<dialog popover>` which would address this issue.\r\n\r\nRegarding modal vs. non-modal, I think letting HTML open modal dialogs without JS is a bit too much power given they render the whole page inert.",
